    "node_id": "MDY6Q29tbWl0MjMyNTI5ODo5YTk4ZmRmNWI2ZTYzNWQ5ZDk3MTBmODdlMWRhNDJhZWFiMTJmZjBk",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Martin Blumenstingl",
        "email": "martin.blumenstingl@googlemail.com",
        "date": "2019-05-20T19:43:50Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Kevin Hilman",
        "email": "khilman@baylibre.com",
        "date": "2019-05-23T01:19:14Z"
      },
      "message": "soc: amlogic: canvas: add support for Meson8, Meson8b and Meson8m2\n\nThe canvas IP on Meson8, Meson8b and Meson8m2 is mostly identical to the\none on GXBB and newer. The only known difference so far is that that the\n\"endianness\" bits are not supported on Meson8m2 and earlier.\n\nAdd new compatible strings and a check in meson_canvas_config() to\nvalidate that the endianness bits cannot be configured on the 32-bit\nSoCs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin Blumenstingl <martin.blumenstingl@googlemail.com>\nReviewed-by: Maxime Jourdan <mjourdan@baylibre.com>\nSigned-off-by: Kevin Hilman <khilman@baylibre.com>",
